)\"></i></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">彩色半透明背景会降低长文阅读对比度</span>","style-glass-dont-plain":"<span style=\"display:block;width:80px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f2;position:relative\"><i style=\"position:absolute;inset:8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">浅色朴素后台：没有背景可透，白做</span>","style-glass-dont-perf":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">📱</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">低性能设备上的全屏模糊会影响滚动和动效</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">移动端需控制范围并准备实色回退</span>","style-glass-dont-contrast":"<span style=\"display:block;width:110px;padding:6px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fbbf24,#34d399)\"><span style=\"display:block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)\">文字对比不足</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">底色过透、模糊过轻会使文字与背景混合</span>"}}}